<section id="testimony" aria-labelledby="t-title">
  <div class="wrap testimony-grid">
    <div class="testimony-intro">
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="t-title">What I saw before God's Throne</h2>
      <p class="lede">The Seven Spirits are only briefly mentioned in Scripture. I share what I was shown in far more detail. I do not contradict the Bible or challenge our beloved clergy. I'm delivering the message I was asked to bring back.</p>
      <blockquote>
        "If you go back to life you should tell people about them, because they are much more important here with God than they are with people on earth."
        <cite>My grandfather, George Russell Quirk</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>A momentary death at nine years old</h3><p>As a fourth grader I was killed by my abusive father, then resuscitated. As soon as my body died, I regained consciousness with vision, memory and emotion, no longer limited by a human body.</p></li>
      <li><h3>My grandfather George met me</h3><p>He told me he was taking me to see God. He showed me God's Throne, the Lamb of God, and the Seven Holy Spirits of God, and explained each one to me.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Seven columns of fire, as vast as stars</h3><p>They are far more than seven flames on a candelabra. They are tall, thin columns of fire shooting upward like the thrust of a rocket, and at their peak the flames come together neatly, like feathers on a bird.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Face to face with Jesus Christ</h3><p>At Heaven's entrance, Jesus materialized and looked directly at me. He wore a white robe and bore four red crucifixion markers on his hands and feet. We looked at each other, but did not speak.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Back to life, with a message</h3><p>CPR restarted my heart and I was pulled back into my body. Now I'm keeping my promise to my grandfather as a messenger for God's Seven Spirits. Our greatest gifts can come from our greatest pain.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="text-link" href="/timeline-of-discovery-on-thereyouarejesus/">Read the full account and timeline</a></p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
